{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2021-10-13 03:00:00', 'title': 'KPN TURNS TO ORACLE TO MODERNIZE OPERATIONS', 'text': "ROTTERDAM, THE NETHERLANDS AND AUSTIN, TEXAS, OCT. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ORACLE TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT DUTCH TELECOMMUNICATIONS LEADER KPN\xa0HAS CHOSEN ORACLE FUSION CLOUD APPLICATIONS SUITE.\xa0THE IMPLEMENTATION, MANAGED BY DELOITTE AND ORACLE CONSULTING, WILL SEE KPN DEPLOY ORACLE FUSION APPLICATIONS FOR FINANCE, SUPPLY CHAIN MANAGEMENT AND HUMAN RESOURCES TO HELP STREAMLINE THE COMPANY'S BUSINESS OPERATIONS."}